  "id": "spectral-scale",
  "term": "spectral scale",
  "definition": "In this context, spectral scale means a frequency-based level of brain signal activity examined after transforming BOLD-fMRI data into wavelet components. It is used to compare functional connectivity patterns across multiple frequency or timescale bands of spontaneous brain activity.",
